% Pseudocode for online AuxIVA-ISS and online AuxIVA-IP, matching the
% implementations in online_auxiva_iss.py and online_auxiva_ip.py.
%
% Differs from Algorithm 1 of Nakashima & Ono (arXiv:2209.00937) in one
% respect: the covariance recursion is written explicitly against the
% previous FRAME's covariance U_{kf,t-1} rather than the running iterate,
% via the snapshot \widetilde{U}. The paper's listing is ambiguous on this
% point; anchoring to the iterate would give an effective forgetting factor
% of \alpha^{N_iter} and inject x x^H once per sweep.
%
% Preamble requirements: algorithm, algpseudocode, amsmath, amssymb, bm.
% Compiles standalone as-is (pdflatex).
